# 1. Purpose

The Landing Page is the public entry point of EV Mobility Platform.

Its purpose is to:

- Explain the product quickly.
- Communicate the EV mobility problem.
- Present the platform solution.
- Demonstrate EV intelligence.
- Demonstrate charging and parking integration.
- Demonstrate IoT capability.
- Build user trust.
- Convert visitors into authenticated users.

The Landing Page must remain a product/marketing experience and must not become the authenticated application dashboard.

